Spec: LinkGate mobile appearance resources

Purpose:
  Supply the LinkGate application name, launcher identity and native theme.

Owns:
  ./values/strings.xml
  ./values/styles.xml
  ./drawable/ic_linkgate.xml
  ./drawable/ic_linkgate_notification.xml

Must:
  Use LinkGate as the launcher name, retain the existing package and signing identity, and keep navigation/status colors readable.
  Use scalable native vector icons without network assets or new UI runtime dependencies.
